{% comment %}
    needs:
        - src\common\components\jky-nav\index.js
        - src\common\components\jky-nav\index.less


    分类tab栏：
        PC/MB：跟随页面进度切换tab，到边界tab后自动移动当前tab进入可视范围
        MB：tab栏可拖拽


    设置当前默认tab：
        jky-nav-item元素设置class ‘active’
        tab对应可视内容：tab上添加自定义属性 ‘target’ 值对应可视版块的自定义属性‘anchor’值

    Accepts:
        - settings: {Array} tabs数组
        - class: {String} 模块样式类名
        - open_trigger: {Boolean} 是否开启埋点事件
        - trigger_event: {String} 埋点事件名称


    Example:
        <div class="sticky-nav">
            <div class="container">
                <jky-nav>
                    <div class="jky-nav-inner">
                        <div class="jky-nav-inner--container">
                            <div class="jky-nav-item active" target="p1">Benefits</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p2">Scenarios</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p3">Conversation</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p4">Winner announcement</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p5">Benefits Benefits Benefits</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p6">Scenarios Scenarios Scenarios</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p7">Conversation Conversation Conversation</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-item" target="p8">Winner announcement Winner announcement</div>
                            <div class="jky-nav-slideline">
                                <div class="jky-nav-slideline--inner"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </jky-nav>
            </div>
        </div>


        <div anchor="p1" style="height: 100vh;background:pink;"></div>
        <div anchor="p2" style="height: 100vh;background:skyblue;"></div>
        <div anchor="p3" style="height: 100vh;background:orange;"></div>
        <div anchor="p4" style="height: 100vh;background:lightgreen;"></div>
        <div anchor="p5" style="height: 100vh;background:rgb(139, 26, 45);"></div>
        <div anchor="p6" style="height: 100vh;background:rgb(59, 31, 180);"></div>
        <div anchor="p7" style="height: 100vh;background:rgb(214, 12, 39);"></div>
        <div anchor="p8" style="height: 100vh;background:rgb(1, 109, 1);"></div>


    Usage:
        {%- render 'jky-nav', tabs: blocks_nav -%}
{% endcomment %}

{%- if tabs.size > 0 -%}
<div class="sticky-nav {{class}}">
    <div class="container">
        <jky-nav>
            <div class="jky-nav-inner">
                <div class="jky-nav-inner--container">
                    {%- for block in tabs -%}
                        <div
                            {%if open_trigger == true %}
                                {% if trigger_event != blank %}
                                    data-ga-event="{{trigger_event}}"
                                {% endif %}
                                data-ga-action="click"
                                data-ga-params-position="{{block.settings.title | escape}}"
                                {%if module != blank %}
                                    data-ga-params-module="{{ module }}"
                                {% else %}
                                    data-ga-params-module="Directory"
                                {% endif %}
                            {% endif %}
                             class="jky-nav-item
                             {%if forloop.index == 1%}
                                active
                             {% endif %}"
                                target="{{block.settings.anchor | escape}}">
                            {{block.settings.title | escape}}</div>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                    <div class="jky-nav-slideline">
                        <div class="jky-nav-slideline--inner"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </jky-nav>
    </div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
